{
 "_about": "parens sweep corpus (2026-10-31): adversarial parentheses through the THREE engines. expect = the row IDs (hand-worked); expect null = parity only, the engines must agree with each other (the reading is whatever the grammar makes of it, as long as it is ONE reading). noFormat = nested columns or forms the scheduler's format engine does not read.",
 "columns": ["#", "ID", "A", "B", "C", "D", "E", "SUBS"],
